Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Implementation code block
   Replaced the original fill-method cleanup, mask-type conversion, and branch-based indexer selection with a call to `_get_fill_func(method)` assigned to `fill_f`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Assignment statement: call `com._clean_fill_method(method)` to update `method`;
   * Assignment statement: call `mask.astype(np.uint8)` to update `mask`;
   * Conditional statement: according to whether `method` was `'pad'` or `'backfill'`, call the corresponding `lib.get_*_indexer(mask)` and assign the result to `indexer`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Assignment statement: call `_get_fill_func(method)` and assign the result to `fill_f`.
